#!/bin/sh
# Fake harness for broker tests. "->pty:ready" is the broker's explicit readiness signal. Like a real CLI
# it consumes submitted input instead of leaving it on screen: the broker treats a body still visible after
# submit as "parked" and fails the delivery.
stty -echo 2>/dev/null
printf "%s\n" "->pty:ready"
exec cat >/dev/null
